>> Animal := Opheto nobo.
>> Factory := Opheto nobo.

Animal ora: ['nobo'] hasi: {
	>> animal := mes nobo.
	animal sound: ['?']. <- animal.
}.

Animal ora: ['sound:'] hasi: { :s
	propio sound := s.
}.

Animal ora: ['sound'] hasi: { <- propio sound.
}.

>> Dog := Opheto nobo.
>> Cat := Opheto nobo.

Dog ora: ['nobo'] hasi: { <- Animal nobo sound: ['woof!'].
}.

Cat ora: ['nobo'] hasi: { <- Animal nobo sound: ['meow!'].
}.

Salida skirbi: Dog nobo sound, liña-nobo.
Salida skirbi: Cat nobo sound, liña-nobo.

Factory ora: ['mix:and:'] hasi: { :beast1 :beast2 <- Animal nobo sound: (
		( beast1 sound kuminsá: 0 largura: 2 ) +
		( beast2 sound kuminsá: 2 largura: 5 )
	).
}.

Salida skirbi: (Factory mix: Dog nobo and: Cat nobo) sound, liña-nobo.
